       ("Federal Register, Beverly, Washington final rule (2024)", "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2024/10/29/2024-25076/establishment-of-the-beverly-washington-viticultural-area"),
       ("Federal Register, proposed Mill Creek-Walla Walla Valley AVA (2026)", "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/14/2026-16669/proposed-establishment-of-the-mill-creek-walla-walla-valley-viticultural-area"),
